# In the Colors view, removing the color of a group's only entry drops the group and focuses the next group's first entry.
file <<END
Sprint:
	- Design @red
	- Build @green
	- Test @green
END
keys gC C
hide Red
see 󰏘 Green
keys C
hide Build
quit
saved <<END
Sprint:
	- Design
	- Build
	- Test @green
END
